## Validation commands

```powershell
python examples\05_validate_case12_tfwz_reference.py
python examples\06_validate_case12_tfTxx_reference.py
```

Run all tests:

```powershell
python -m compileall src\mms_viscoelastic
python -m pytest -q
```

